{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live the life of an aspiring arms dealer in a Cyberpunk city. Complete thrilling bullet-hell combat simulations with your trusty battle mech, while managing your precious stock of weapons. Drink coffee for combat boosts, hunt bounties, and overcome difficult battle modifiers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Satisfying Movement and Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the simulated environment, your mech responds flawlessly to your command. Push the machine to its limits as you navigate complex terrain, while engaging in bullet-hell battles with swarms of enemies. Time your rolls to negate incoming damage, or use them to get to a favourable position. The movement and gunplay is easy to learn, but hard to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023590/extras/01c103323f8c826d21708034d24a43d5.poster.avif?t=1771137666\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023590/extras/01c103323f8c826d21708034d24a43d5.webm?t=1771137666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023590/extras/01c103323f8c826d21708034d24a43d5.mp4?t=1771137666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique Weapons and Enemies</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15+ weapons, bullets, and abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permanently upgrade your mech to  match your combat style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn the weaknesses of a cast of unique enemies, and adapt your arsenal and strategy to strike them down.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As larger contracts come your way, the enemies grow stronger and gain new abilities. No two battles are the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with endless loadout possibilities. Some combinations are more powerful than others, but sometimes you must get creative with whatever you have in stock.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficult bounty battles, and 2 boss fights!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023590/extras/caf3b5c50b3f54ed4379c620244dddea.poster.avif?t=1771137666\" width=480 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023590/extras/caf3b5c50b3f54ed4379c620244dddea.webm?t=1771137666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023590/extras/caf3b5c50b3f54ed4379c620244dddea.mp4?t=1771137666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Additional Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do business with whacky characters living in this Cyberpunk world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the main quest-line at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your relationships with friends and business partners, giving permanent buffs to future runs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hardmode with an added challenge; have money ready for when the debt collector visits, or suffer his wrath.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy office with a beautiful soundtrack and customisable wallpaper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023590/extras/58f86bc221fda13422349ca25a7ca67d.poster.avif?t=1771137666\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023590/extras/58f86bc221fda13422349ca25a7ca67d.webm?t=1771137666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023590/extras/58f86bc221fda13422349ca25a7ca67d.mp4?t=1771137666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4023590?t=1771137666","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023590/fdcdb5e7e394b49327a4f15c92e4e33639f18499/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771137666","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023590/6bee18e29f2de5fb7e980ea5b52910e54243675d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771137666","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023590/6bee18e29f2de5fb7e980ea5b52910e54243675d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771137666","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live the life of an aspiring arms dealer in a Cyberpunk city. Complete thrilling bullet-hell combat simulations with your trusty battle mech, while managing your precious stock of weapons. Drink coffee for combat boosts, hunt bounties, and overcome difficult battle modifiers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Satisfying Movement and Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the simulated environment, your mech responds flawlessly to your command. Push the machine to its limits as you navigate complex terrain, while engaging in bullet-hell battles with swarms of enemies. Time your rolls to negate incoming damage, or use them to get to a favourable position. The movement and gunplay is easy to learn, but hard to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023590/extras/01c103323f8c826d2170803